  "description": "Our Reid Let’s range is designed to be the most accessible route to a quality eBike for all. The Let’s Commute makes cycling to work easy, accessible, and sweat free!\nDesigned to be your dependable partner for cutting across town, the Let’s Commute is as simple and reliable as an eBike can get. With a fully integrated battery and controller, easily serviceable gears and brakes from top brands, sealed bearing bottom bracket, and 45c tyres, it’s made to take everything commuting throws at it. On the move you have a powerful 250w motor with five levels of assist making cycling as effortless as you desire, and with a 375wh battery you’ll be surprised at how many times you’ll make the trip to work without having to charge.\nIf you want to change the way you get to work, remove another polluting car from the road, or simply be free from the jams, the Let’s Commute is your perfect choice.\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
